    "evidence": "Fresh anti-anchored source review from this packet/current primary source. Independently read both entire new production modules and entire Test, all selected authored formula proof steps, publication assumptions/differences and current cell snapshots. Checked real synchronous marginal construction, ENNReal arbitrary/infinite-cost infimum reasoning, genuine kernel/Markov/integrated-law identities, actual source Q and actual two-refresh/two-Picard Phi. Source constants/indexing/curvature scope verified against versioned source. Matching parent whole-proof freeze reused only after raw/LF checks; current called interfaces and relevant producer code reread. Canonical packet/source/statement/reconstruction/decoder and complete selected publication binding independently recomputed. Fresh direct production/production/Test elaboration passed as auxiliary evidence, not fidelity evidence. No source, theorem, exposure or whole-module mismatch identified for this scoped component.",
