      "attribution": "Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu, Matthew S. Zhang; ASTIS explicit transport prerequisite/actual-kernel interface, not the full local-error or main result."
    },
    "statement": "Construct a Markov K whose law at every z is Gamma.map(zeta -> Phi(z,zeta)). For all probability mu,nu, K composed with each input equals the actual pushforward Phi#(input×Gamma), and W_M²(Kmu,Knu)<=(1-h/(65536kappa))² W_M²(mu,nu). This is the actual deterministic exact-gradient Gaussian numerical kernel, not an arbitrary supplied contracting kernel and not an invariant-target theorem.",
